{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794491125,"nonce":"Xr+Fnmr2WN2JryQATE9hIgJDFuQ=","title":"L7 — FX rate and comparison pipeline","message":"## Context\nOrchestrates one Compare run: scrape → landed cost → parallel advocates → judge → stats, streaming progress events the UI will render. This layer is plan Task 9 (`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-12-maeve.md:335`).\n\n## Files\n- `src/fx.rs`, `src/pipeline.rs` — new; export from `src/lib.rs`\n- `Cargo.toml` — add `futures`, `tokio-stream` if used\n\n## Approach\n- FX: `fetch_rate` from `https://open.er-api.com/v6/latest/USD` (`rates.UYU`), `pick_rate` (manual \u003e today's cache \u003e fetch)\n- Pipeline: implement plan Task 9 Interfaces (`ItemInput`, `CompareInput`, `ComparisonResult`, `PipelineError`, `PipelineEvent`, `run_comparison\u003cS: Scraper, L: Llm\u003e`). Scrape only items without a `product`; stop with `NotEnoughProducts` before any LLM call if fewer than 2 remain; retry invalid advocate/judge output once\n- Spawn the work, return the stream via an mpsc channel\n\n## Depends on\nL1, L3 (`Scraper`), L4 (`Llm`), L5 (prompts/parsers), L6 (`build_stat_table`)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Plan Task 9 Step 1 tests pass with `FakeScraper`/`FakeLlm`: event order on the happy path, pre-filled products not re-scraped, 2-of-3 failures → `NotEnoughProducts` with zero LLM requests (Review Focus 2), 1-of-3 failure → `excluded.len() == 1`, invalid-then-valid judge → Ok, `Auth` aborts promptly\n- `pick_rate`/`fetch_rate` tests pass (wiremock)\n- Gates pass: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test`","files":null}]}